ADD skiL-pin2 6558 blue
CONNECT skiL-pin2.pin1~ -> skiL-bent1.hole7~ STIFF
CONNECT skiL-pin2.pin2~ -> skiL-long1.hole1~ STIFF
WHY Adds the long lime beam that will run forward to the ski, pinned to the bent beam's far end.
