CONNECT skiL-pin3.pin1~ -> skiL-long1.hole13~ TURNS
CONNECT skiL-pin3.pin2~ -> skiL-knuckle1.hole1~ TURNS
WHY Builds the steering knuckle: an angled connector and a perpendicular connector joined by a short axle, free to swivel on the forward arm.
