ADD brace-perp1 32184 black
ADD brace-perp2 32184 black
ADD brace-axle3 32073 lightgray
CONNECT brace-axle3.axle1~ -> brace1.axlehole2~ LOCKED
CONNECT brace-axle3.axle2~ -> brace-perp1.axlehole1~ LOCKED
CONNECT brace-axle3.axle4~ -> brace-perp2.axlehole1~ LOCKED
CONNECT brace-axle3.axle5~ -> brace3.axlehole2~ LOCKED
WHY Locks two perpendicular connectors onto the axle connectors, then threads the long axle through both to tie the rear brace together.
STEP 38
ADD brace-link1 32005a black
ADD brace-link2 32005a black
ADD tail-bush1 3749 tan
ADD tail-cap1 32526 white
ADD tail-bracket1 60483 darkgray
ADD tail-bracket2 60483 darkgray
ADD tail-cap-axle1 4519 lightgray
CONNECT brace-link1.pin1~ -> rail2.hole5~ STIFF
CONNECT brace-link1.pin4~ -> brace-perp1.hole1~ STIFF
CONNECT brace-link2.pin1~ -> rail3.hole5~ STIFF
CONNECT brace-link2.pin4~ -> brace-perp2.hole1~ STIFF
CONNECT tail-bush1.axle1~ -> brace2.axlehole2~ LOCKED
CONNECT tail-bush1.pin1~ -> seat1.hole1~ TURNS
CONNECT tail-bracket1.axlehole1~ -> tail-bush1.axle1~ LOCKED
CONNECT tail-bracket2.axlehole1~ -> brace-axle2.axle1~ LOCKED
CONNECT tail-cap-axle1.axle1~ -> tail-cap1.hole1~ TURNS
CONNECT tail-cap-axle1.axle3~ -> tail-bracket2.axlehole1~ LOCKED
WHY Pins the last two links from the rail to the seat mount and caps the brace with a bush, a tooth cap and two small brackets, finishing the chassis.
